@startuml
title Context map

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "Identity\n(identity provider)" as IAM #ECEFF1
component "Catalog\ncatalog-service" as CAT
component "Inventory\ninventory-service" as INV #FFE0B2
component "Cart\ncart-service" as CART
component "Order\norder-service" as ORD #FFE0B2
component "Payment\npayment-service" as PAY
component "Notification\nnotification-service" as NOT
component "Payment provider" as PSP #ECEFF1
component "E-mail provider" as MAIL #ECEFF1

CART --> CAT : reads prices and status\n<<synchronous>>
ORD --> CAT : reads prices at checkout\n<<synchronous>>
ORD --> CART : reads the cart at checkout\n<<synchronous>>
CAT ..> INV : listens to availability\n<<events>>
ORD <..> INV : reserve, confirm, release, return\n<<commands and events>>
ORD <..> PAY : charge, cancel, refund\n<<commands and events>>
CART ..> ORD : listens to confirmed orders\n<<events>>
NOT ..> ORD : listens to order changes\n<<events>>
PAY --> PSP : anti-corruption layer
NOT --> MAIL : anti-corruption layer
ORD -[hidden]up-> IAM

legend right
  Orange: core subdomain
  Gray: not built by us
  Solid arrow: synchronous read
  Dotted arrow: messages
endlegend
@enduml
